		{"id":"dc0c5163cfe2b1cf","type":"text","text":"### Fight to install Manim\nMan I would spend much time trying to install Manim and don't used properly, and I could say that is too good for be true. And really that is hard, you have to install like three dependencies, Cairo, Latex, and more stuff and also establish the connections between this. ","x":-134,"y":-660,"width":294,"height":180},
