		{"id":"222d1a1b6237bfa6","type":"text","text":"### Book for code.\nIs gross use chatgtp for code I fell like dirty.\nNow I think that the best is print a list of commands that are very useful, or maybe use something virtual, that I could carry to everywhere. What is better the virtual I would say. I'm sure that exist. Books on this\n","x":395,"y":100,"width":245,"height":193},
