		{"id":"5afa1118938c2769","type":"text","text":"### Mouse N.N\nWhat about the mouse (pointer) this could be modified for another application?\nI mean it's very simple it only use two coordinates and three buttons. Probably it could be interesting i.","x":-400,"y":-976,"width":243,"height":189},
		{"id":"65ae81077289bc01","type":"text","text":"### Linux User\nMean you can't deny that have that the world of software is simply amazing. And one philosophy mark is take the most of the hardware with minimalist UI. I need that pretty old Isa's laptop  ","x":-380,"y":660,"width":263,"height":220},
		{"id":"7c66d8b6da7fb047","type":"text","text":"### Programmer Keyboard\nThis keyboards for programmers are simply beautiful. But actually I don't feel comfortable programming, I guess that it's pretty when you challenge yourself. Before I find programming exciting because ideas come to mind, and the image of that idea realized was very pretty, I need one idea. \nIt seem it to me that that project that you make, grow over time, until it transform something the sufficient decent to be uploaded to _GitHub_. A good one for OOP is this interface for obsidian, \n\nI'm gonna buy when this two leave of work. ","x":-98,"y":660,"width":261,"height":220},
		{"id":"bfd0c34d5e4bc19f","type":"text","text":"### Talk with a personalized.\nI already prove talk ChatGTP and is amazing, now imagine this, use one laptop to talk with an AI but that is completely native, I mean I could use that Lenovo, but that only task is possible. We really love linux that could make possible that. Is about optimization. ","x":-375,"y":894,"width":254,"height":261},
		{"id":"98524e688b7f5f26","type":"text","text":"### YT account to upload ML papers. Technical stuff.\nI remember that one man make this kind of content, and why I did could make the same, and of that content I could create content to GitHub and LinkedIn, I could begin right now. And publish one each certain time. ","x":-98,"y":900,"width":326,"height":280},
