		{"id":"554ef1e7ae290483","type":"text","text":"### I have three laptops to install ubuntu?\nThey actually are very difficult to use, the question is if the hardware is broken or something. I guess for Linux Projects are amazing they don't already have nothing to worry inside.  ","x":-1198,"y":-113,"width":585,"height":153},
		{"id":"10ca0f755c393fcf","type":"text","text":"### Reinforcement Learning to mouse\nLet's assume that in somehow I'm able to control the mouse, I could it train to give click in certain parts. I could create a model of the environment?\nI mean, It would be awesome that the mouse works lonely. The environment should be very well defined. A one like the desktop is very complex to predict.\nI mean the mouse only have four actions that is the simple","x":-1548,"y":-113,"width":328,"height":205},
		{"id":"5c8fbc7c765bf976","type":"text","text":"### I have routers and Ethernet cables on Pilcomayo, train models with all the possible laptops.\nI didn't throw away those routers, if I could use it it will be amazing that is how science works, and is true respect the Ethernet cable, if we want to connect more than two laptops we are going to need a place where all of them connect. And many Ethernet cables, I need to recuperate it them, and again buy a Ethernet to USB, but this time of true. I need to comeback to Pilcomayo. That is so exciting. We could learn a lot about servers and stuff.","x":-1548,"y":-379,"width":328,"height":240},
		{"id":"2a3798859d807941","type":"text","text":"### Google Colab VsCode To Take Notes\nImagine takes notes like I make, with the Zettelkasten philosophy but adding code using the .pynb file, good. The notes that the professor taught in C++ classes were good the true. ","x":-1198,"y":-364,"width":401,"height":225},
		{"id":"62cb6aee65eca4bb","type":"text","text":"###  ML Notebook from Google\nThis thing of audio it seem it to me very interesting. I think is a really good website.","x":-1880,"y":-319,"width":300,"height":180},
		{"id":"39766f9284ecddf7","type":"text","text":"### Certifications of Computer Science\nI mean I'm doing a career on Physics, but I'm more engaged with Software and Hardware stuff, I mean it's more rentable, of course I'm not going to change the career, the actual University where I am is pretty bad, being **autodidact** is the best that one could make. ","x":-663,"y":-683,"width":263,"height":203},
		{"id":"8c2c094aeb8474b6","type":"text","text":"### Cryptocurrency\nToday at morning how I arrive late I saw this teen making some stuff related to cryptocurrency, and I don't think that worth waste time and energy to gain cents, the more interesting relies on Mining crypt. But for that you need to have a vast knowledge. The problems are energy, cooling, communication and have good GPU's.","x":177,"y":-693,"width":266,"height":213},
		{"id":"5c6ef41508f5b8b4","type":"text","text":"### Renewable Energy \nI remember that I make that project in the elementary school, I was able to turn on a led moving this thing, I think that in the future have a vast knowledge and perform project on these, And the best fund is the [[Sun what is it]]. ","x":177,"y":-860,"width":292,"height":145},
		{"id":"ddff6e282204abcc","type":"text","text":"## Hacker, so complex\nI mean I admire their knowledge on software. I mean in this world where all is software is necessary have a good understand of this. ","x":-134,"y":-881,"width":294,"height":198},
