		{"id":"9158bd6e8cbc9929","type":"text","text":"### USB = Booter\nI was thinking on my past and in school I always use the windows system, here it was the first time that I used the Linux OS. And I fell in love, actually I can't leave of think on it. Now I would be able of use my USB like the booter or even more personalized environment? I mean this is possibility that Linux opens because think of this with windows it seem it to me impossible, because I think on use in the most minimalism profile possible, and here we need USB, man save and be careful with USB are very important to create Linux environments.\nAnd the best is I can run my profile \n","x":395,"y":320,"width":415,"height":236},
		{"id":"c7d15bcf294e73db","type":"text","text":"### Links\n\nAlso there are interesting web sites [Firecrawl](https://www.firecrawl.dev/) (convert websites into data), [GitHub](https://github.com/) ,[llm arena](https://lmarena.ai/?leaderboard), [Unsloth ](https://unsloth.ai/) (A library where you could change the kernel of GPU and CPU), [metric](https://github.com/openai/evals),[verl](https://verl.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html),[ai future](https://ai-2027.com/) ,[fine tune llama](https://github.com/Shubhamsaboo/awesome-llm-apps/tree/main/llm_finetuning_tutorials/llama3.2_finetuning),[strong each time](https://x.com/AIatMeta/status/1908598456144531660). Firebase\nSome Resources to implement: [[Natural Language]],[[Neural Networks and Deep Learning]],Free courses EdX.","x":660,"y":100,"width":250,"height":193},
		{"id":"a70200371fe8e217","type":"text","text":"### All application that I use should be programmed for me\nObsidian for instance, is not a good idea, but I mean is scalable on time, it's true that at the beginning it's the most basic but with time you could add more things.\nThe development of Apps on Android and Desktop, is incredible interesting when you use it.\nIt's like use a computer from 1990, there is the question respect the kernel and that stuff but is a really good project, I mean I really want to have a laptop to put it a light OS, and only use the terminal , this laptop is for learn. And also a phone to trash all, and use the terminal, what bad I ... could be?\nThe same for the PC.\nImagine create a kernel, that is really complex and high level. ","x":925,"y":100,"width":295,"height":193},
		{"id":"8f4da9186f44fc7d","type":"text","text":"### Zettelkasten Philosophy to Code\nI could create a canvas and there put all the code I have. This for don't forget it of course. [[Code.canvas]]. Of course that I could make a note for each code but that is a huge work.","x":785,"y":-121,"width":279,"height":200},
		{"id":"cb1f4622b75d25bf","type":"text","text":"### Begin, a server on Linux\nI mean not for nothing I have this operative system,  [[Linux change your view about software]]. I could create a local server to share files because use Gmail for that is ugly.\nAnd I can put it and interface and add more funcionalities.","x":395,"y":-321,"width":366,"height":140},
		{"id":"e740bc7dbea12f30","type":"text","text":"### Automate things I need to remember.\nWhen I open my phone or tablet I need options, like a set of notes I would to remember, this canvas and more. And the unique available. I mean if you could automate all you can, is save time, I really like the idea of convert myself an \"automata\".","x":785,"y":-280,"width":308,"height":139},
		{"id":"221c7d7d0aef4a69","type":"text","text":"### Automatic Bike\nI mean I never was able to biking with no using hands, that is something of the past, now I want that my bike drive itself with computer vision. And something of mechanics, that it would be really awesome, Imagine it, only need to pedal while reading book  and any worry. That only could happen on a ideal world where everything goes right. But Tesla already do it, and I guess that is not that complex.","x":-1198,"y":-620,"width":318,"height":239},
		{"id":"4b3866d113964e7d","type":"text","text":"### Veer\nDiana create that website, now I am need to be the one who is gonna to do the maintenance, and think in the long run. I mean I could say that is mine, (only true I overpass to Diana with the effort put it). And this open the doors to make some stuff with INDECOPI, patentes and that stuff. That is not amazing?  \nWhat Tanjiro says help at the end is help to one self. ","x":-1878,"y":-113,"width":298,"height":218},
		{"id":"757131e08ed2eddd","type":"text","text":"### Agents\nNow that we are gonna to use GPU more like that Lambda, and we have some interesting tools that comes from AI, I mean each time are more accessible the models, more cheaps the rent of GPUS, and vision stuff is simply amazing.\n\nI mean I could integrate vision models using that camera, and recognize what I am doing. And intermingle with LLM's agent\n\nI mean the workflow could be completely change.\n\nI actually use keyshorts, but the future is signs, and after brain signs Nanana. Each time know to code is important, they are not gonna to reemplace programers they are going to need more than ever. The only way that it completely works is by knowing what are you doing. \n\nThe camera idea sound pretty good, I tried before but it was like a wall. Now we are more equippaded. I mean is pretty recurrent know that are tons of guys performing on vision models.\n\nWhich is very sorprendent. There a ton of make. And this is never gonna to stop. Is simply crazy, is the third revolution. I'm ","x":785,"y":-540,"width":495,"height":249},
